      "id": "claim_2f598fb651514350a0724e7f9be2385d",
      "statement": "AuthorizationService.update is the primary web 3DS callback handler, routed for both POST and GET on /authorizations/:authorization_id; it validates the authorization_id and brand_id params (redirecting a VALIDATION_ERROR on absence) before fetching authorization details.",
