      "statement": "migrationVerifyOtp supports legacy OTP verification flows, parsing the authorization id from the submitted vpc_AuthURL, checking MSP authorization state, and forwarding the OTP to the PSP; approval parses merchant_return query parameters into a vpc response while failure sets vpc_TxnResponseCode=3.",
