      "id": "claim_b16f1ef08e024dd7ba30d430df6d8286",
      "statement": "isFinalPaymentState treats the payment state as final only for approved, failed, canceled, or expired values; any other state (created, pending, missing, malformed) returns false so that update redirects to the invoice URL to prevent duplicate processing.",
